### ====================================
### ZEROTIER NETWORK REQUESTS
### ====================================

### 1. Получить статус сервера через ZeroTier
GET http://10.243.212.4:8081/api/status
Accept: application/json

### 2. Регистрация пользователя через ZeroTier
POST http://10.243.212.4:8081/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "zerotier_user",
  "email": "user@zerotier.net",
  "password": "zt12345",
  "full_name": "ZeroTier User",
  "course": "1",
  "role": "student"
}

### 3. Авторизация через ZeroTier
POST http://10.243.212.4:8081/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "zerotier_user",
  "password": "zt12345"
}

### 4. Получить свой профиль
GET http://10.243.212.4:8081/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 5. Проверка доступности API
GET http://10.243.212.4:8081/api/health
Accept: application/json

### 6. Получить всех пользователей (только для админов)
GET http://10.243.212.4:8081/api/users/all
Authorization: Bearer ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 7. Создать задачу через ZeroTier
POST http://10.243.212.4:8081/api/tasks/create
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "title": "Task via ZeroTier",
  "description": "Created from private network",
  "priority": "medium",
  "assigned_to": "zerotier_user"
}